4Z","value":6,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=2669070","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2483700-1846651706693531","game_id":"steam-2483700","kind":"update","title":"HARMA Demo Update: Act 2 Is Now Available!","summary":"Hello everyone,It’s been four days since the HARMA demo went live, and we’ve received so much support, thoughtful feedback, and stories from your runs. Thank you to everyone who has taken the time to play and share their thoughts with us.After hearing your feedback, we’ve decided to make a substantial addition to the demo: Act 2 is now available, letting you take your adventure further!Two difficulty settings. Two complete acts.You can now play through all of Act 1 and Act 2 on both difficulty s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:11:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2483700-1846651706679920","game_id":"steam-2483700","kind":"announcement","title":"HARMA Steam Next Fest Demo Now Available with 2-Player Online Co-op","summary":"Dear Players,The HARMA Steam Next Fest demo is now available, featuring an all-new 2-player online co-op mode, two difficulty settings, expanded card archetypes, and a range of newly implemented gameplay mechanisms.Developed by a team of dedicated deckbuilding fans, HARMA is scheduled for release in 2026. This Steam Next Fest build offers an early look at the game’s core systems and progression.2-Player Online Co-opFor the first time, players can invite a Steam friend and experience HARMA togeth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679920","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2483700-1843481262700671","game_id":"steam-2483700","kind":"announcement","title":"HARMA Closed Playtest Recruitment","summary":"Hello players!We are currently recruiting participants for a new round of closed playtesting for HARMA.HARMA is a roguelike deckbuilder that combines traditional deckbuilding with RPG elements such as character attributes and equipment. It also features a unique Attunement system, which causes card effects to vary depending on the results of Artifact checks, as well as a two-player co-op mode.We are looking for experienced players who can help us evaluate the game’s core systems, card and build ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T04:07:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700671","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2483700-1815034433004550","game_id":"steam-2483700","kind":"announcement","title":"Harma Demo is Now Available!","summary":"Hello players! The first demo version of Harma is now live! https://store.steampowered.com/app/2669070/HARMA_Demo/ The demo includes: Main cards from three core archetypes, plus a wide variety of basic cards A rich collection of relics and passive effects with unique mechanics Several normal enemies, elites, and a boss battle Many special events to discover Core deck management systems — card shop, upgrade branching, removal options, and more Full-color hand-drawn pixel art and original soundtra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-03T15:26:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815034433004550","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2483700-1802893906895352","game_id":"steam-2483700","kind":"announcement","title":"A Tale of Revenge and Madness! HARMA is set to launch in 2025!","summary":"Dear Players,This is INDIRECT SHINE.We are extremely excited to reveal our roguelike deck-builder, HARMA, today!HARMA is a retro dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilding game featuring a story-driven campaign. Uncover the truth behind the fallen knights, the burning kingdom, and your missing father. Harness the power of mighty artifacts to defeat demons and save a world on the brink of destruction.Set to launch in late 2025, HARMA invites players into a rich narrative experience powered by dynamic ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-24T16:02:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802893906895352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2483700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2483700":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2483700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z"},"2669070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:01Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2483700","app_id":2483700,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1f63d191255affb90d3c7bf